2. "It isn't the sort of thing one should talk of in private."

Here one can say 

   "na bilga lo'edu'u tavla fa lo'e mibypre fi le'e du va'o lo sivni"

... but I would like to be able to capture the "sort of thing" of the
original. So I used {dzadanlu} as a lujvo for "x1 is of sort x2" --
I was fairly happy to base it on danlu; the dza was for lack of
anything better.

